			title: "Cut the Ice for Muskellunge and Rainbow Trout"
			subtitle: "Nella's Ice Auger goes through it."
			icon: "aquaculture:muskellunge"
			description: ["Nella, flat: \"Lake's a floor now, and the auger goes through it. Fish underneath don't know it's winter.\"", "", "Cut a hole in the lake ice with Nella's Ice Auger, then catch 4 Muskellunge and 4 Rainbow Trout through it. Both want the deep cold out past the pier — cut where the ice is dark, not white, and put a worm on the hook.", "", "Winter tackle and two trophy mounts for the inn wall — and Nella has something to do until spring."]
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
			dependencies: ["2214CAF2EDA521CB"]
