		{
			id: "7706D9D51C1DA618"
			title: "Brew 8 Winter Tonics, One for Each Neighbour"
			subtitle: "At Halden's still, west of the square."
			icon: "valley:winter_tonic"
			description: ["Halden, slowly: \"Eight people, eight bottles. I would go round myself, but they talk to you more than they talk to me.\"", "", "Brew 8 Winter Tonics at Halden's still, west of the square by the hedge garden. A Flask, a Green Tea Leaf and one sugar makes two, and his hedge-gate payout left you four flasks and sixteen leaves. Hold all eight at hand-in.", "", "Nobody in the valley gets sick this winter, and Halden stops being the only one who checks."]
