			description: ["Bram: \"Built it, piped it, didn't furnish it. That end's not mine.\"", "", "Set an Oak Bench, an Oak Shelf and a Lantern on each of the twelve marked spots in the bathhouse behind the inn — thirty-six pieces, and all thirty-six came in the coolant-loop payout. Any order is right.", "", "This payout restocks all three, twelve apiece. The bathhouse opens: his waste heat becomes a warm room people sit in."]
