			subtitle: "Forty marked blocks of fall, then the Waystone."
			icon: "thermal:flux_drill"
			description: ["Tobin, fast: \"The fall is forty blocks of it, I paced it twice, and behind forty blocks is the entire works, and I have not slept.\"", "", "Mine the 40 marked blocks out of the fallen adit into Josie's Works, then place the Waystone on the marked plinth inside. The Works Pick came with the cellar wall.", "", "The Works lights up, her Flux Drill is on the bench charged and ready for the yellorite, and there is a saddled horse in the stable."]
