: \"The Works\", \"color\": \"gold\"}", elevate_perms: true, silent: true }, { id: "3C3E5CD89CB28DAD", type: "command", auto: "enabled", command: "execute at @p run playsound minecraft:block.bell.resonate master @p ~ ~ ~ 1 1", elevate_perms: true, silent: true }, { id: "286CE11A7D1EDE18", type: "toast", title: "The Works Is Open", auto: "enabled", description: "Next: run Energy Duct from the mill to the Works and fit 2 Energy Cells. The compass in this payout is already set to the Wandering Merchant's Tower." }]
